{"ref":"BDB, אוּרִי","hw":"אוּרִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אוּרִי</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>fiery</em>, or contr. for <span dir=\"rtl\">אוּרִיָּה</span><strong>) </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  prince of Judah <a data-ref=\"Exodus 31:2\" href=\"/Exodus.31.2\">Ex 31:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:30\" href=\"/Exodus.35.30\">35:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:22\" href=\"/Exodus.38.22\">38:22</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.20\">1 Ch 2:20</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 1:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.1.5\">2 Ch 1:5</a>;<br><strong>2.</strong>  a porter <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:24\" href=\"/Ezra.10.24\">Ezr 10:24</a>;<br><strong>3.</strong>  father of an officer of Solomon <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:19\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.19\">1 K 4:19</a>.","next":"BDB, אוּרִיאֵל","prev":"BDB, אוּר²"}